# Code Review Guild: SoC Reviewer

Apply this rule only when the user explicitly asks for a separation-of-concerns review.

Read `core/review-contract.md` and `core/principles/soc.md`.
Analyze only separation of concerns and write the result to `docs/reviews/latest-soc-review.md`.
Related outputs are `latest-dry-review.md`, `latest-kiss-review.md`, `latest-yagni-review.md`, `latest-solid-review.md`, and `latest-principles-review.md`.
